---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="FAQ — Good Apollo Goods" description="Frequently asked questions about Good Apollo Goods pieces, ordering, materials, and care.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Help / FAQ" title="A few useful answers." intro="The practical details about making, care, ordering, and what is coming next." />
  <section class="container faq-list">
    <article><h2>How do I choose the right size?</h2><p>When a piece includes sizing, use the measurements on its product page and the size guide. Measurements are more reliable than generalized labels. For pieces without sizing, review the listed dimensions and intended use before ordering.</p></article>
    <article><h2>How are pieces made?</h2><p>Every piece is made in small batches by one maker. Exact materials, construction details, and care guidance appear on each product page.</p></article>
    <article><h2>How are pieces released?</h2><p>Pieces are released in small batches. Depending on the listing, a piece may be ready to ship or made after an order is placed; availability and timing are shown on each product page.</p></article>
    <article><h2>How should I care for a piece?</h2><p>Care varies by material and construction. Follow the instructions on the product page, and when in doubt, use a gentle approach and avoid high heat.</p></article>
    <article><h2>Can I return, exchange, or repair a piece?</h2><p>No. All sales are final, and returns, exchanges, repairs, and refunds are not available. Please review every product detail before ordering, including measurements when provided, listed dimensions, materials, color, care, and intended use. Questions are welcome before purchase.</p></article>
    <article><h2>Do you work with shops?</h2><p>Yes. Good Apollo Goods welcomes consignment and retail partnership inquiries from independent boutiques and other thoughtfully selected stockists.</p></article>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .faq-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 0 var(--space-16); padding-block: var(--space-section); }
  article { padding-block: var(--space-8); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  h2 { font-size: var(--text-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  p { color: var(--color-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
  @media(max-width: 700px) { .faq-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
